Here’s a **diagram-style comparison** of **REST vs RPC** that you can visualize like a class or structural chart to help you remember easily:

---

```
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           |       REST         |                     |        RPC         |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | Resource-Oriented  |                     | Action-Oriented    |
           | Uses Nouns         |                     | Uses Verbs         |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | URL: /users/123    |                     | URL: /getUser?id=123|
           | (Resource ID)      |                     | (Method Call)       |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | HTTP Verbs:        |                     | Mostly uses POST   |
           | GET, POST, PUT     |                     |                    |
           | DELETE             |                     |                    |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | Stateless, Cacheable|                    | Not inherently     |
           |                    |                     | stateless          |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | Follows HTTP Specs |                     | Custom Protocols   |
           | (Standardized)     |                     | (e.g., gRPC)       |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | Example:           |                     | Example:           |
           | GET /orders/45     |                     | POST /getOrder     |
           |                    |                     | Body: {id: 45}     |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
           | Good for CRUD APIs |                     | Good for Complex   |
           |                    |                     | Actions            |
           +--------------------+                     +--------------------+
```

---

### 🔑 Quick Mnemonics:

* **REST** = **R**esource-based, **E**asy to cache, **S**calable, **T**raditional web.
* **RPC** = **R**emote **P**rocedure **C**all (like function calls over the network).

